    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im disappearing lately. not like physically, but just... everything that makes me \"me\" feels like it's thinning out. like i'm looking at my own life through a thick fog and i can't even remember what it felt like to actually be present in my own head. it's getting harder to recognize myself.",
