      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt really feel like i'm making space for anything new though. it just feels like the lights are being turned off one by one. if the person who actually lived these moments is gone, then what's the point of even being here to watch the fog? it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own body.",
